### Create team
POST http://localhost:8080/api/teams
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Launch Team",
  "description": "Execution squad for product delivery"
}

### List teams for user
GET http://localhost:8080/api/teams
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Add member to team
POST http://localhost:8080/api/teams/1/members/2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
